<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 920)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Asobi 1.0.</b> The milestone release: the designed manual, deliveries to Suite, Drive, Dropbox, Box and Frame.io, reviews over the internet with review copies for every seat, and the source-links and media-provenance work of the last week.</li>
<li><b>The manual, designed.</b> A new edition of the PDF manual and the Reviewer Guide: a framing-chart cover, part dividers, chapter openers with the chapter's own screenshot framed by gate marks, the reading text in Source Serif with Archivo headings, keycap shortcuts, a contents page with every section and its page, a tighter index, PDF bookmarks, and the license as the final pages.</li>
<li><b>Help &#8250; Asobi Manual</b> follows the same design: the chapter numeral and title, numbered sections with the yellow tick, serif reading text, keycaps.</li>
<li><b>The splash</b> sets the name the way the manual's cover does: Archivo Expanded, in the same yellow.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
